sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Streichan et al. (2018), Mayer et al. (2010) & Lefebvre et al. (2023) Drosophila global morphogenetic flow & active nematic myosin tensor mechanics — MorphoEval overall 57.6/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2018-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow.py` (58.7/100). The initial script verifies the trace-free active nematic stress tensor identity and compares basic wild-type vs isotropic-only flow profiles, but uses an analytic surrogate rather than an explicit 2D spectral/finite-difference compressible Stokes-Brinkman PDE solver `eta*nabla^2 v + eta_b*nabla(nabla.v) - (eta/ell_H^2)*v = -nabla.sigma^a`, lacks all 6 Streichan et al. (2018) wild-type and mutant regimes (`wildtype_gbe_anisotropic_plus_pmg`, `anisotropic_dv_cables_only`, `twist_snail_ventral_furrow_mutant`, `isotropic_myosin_only_no_nematic_q`, `eve_pair_rule_mutant`, and `bcd_nos_tsl_maternal_triple_mutant`), lacks the 2D `(ell_H x eta_b/eta)` parameter morphospace, and does not yet perform automated computer-vision segmentation of embryo contour, pair-rule stripe spacing, and dorsal-posterior invagination geometry on `drosophila_germband_extension_specimen.jpg`. Overall 57.6/100 (faithfulness 55.5, reproducibility 62.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 60, Morphological realism / specimen match 52, Parameter expressivity 56, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 61. Output judged: docs/media/global_morphogenetic_flow_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-streichan-global-morphogenetic-flow.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 337692 B, 1820×585 px, artifact_sha256 e49de2ffd51715699c93a4084da3c75feeee4b0616b78e3b91f8f271da2feb7e (sha256 e49de2ffd51715699c93a4084da3c75feeee4b0616b78e3b91f8f271da2feb7e), spec_fingerprint c6f91e927b85c9e6c96461d53e4ae9c082d9c0ad9d74ed650b6b2f21fb08b782. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c6f91e927b85c9e6c96461d53e4ae9c082d9c0ad9d74ed650b6b2f21fb08b782; artifact_sha256: e49de2ffd51715699c93a4084da3c75feeee4b0616b78e3b91f8f271da2feb7e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/global_morphogenetic_flow/drosophila_germband_extension_specimen.jpg=2d7fad8f57edcadf..., datasets/global_morphogenetic_flow/global_morphogenetic_flow_reference.json=160ead86ff9c447b..., datasets/global_morphogenetic_flow/scout_manifest.json=990f3ea83019f3d1...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add automated CV segmentation of the prolate spheroid embryo contour, 8 pair-rule trunk stripes, DV cable gradient anisotropy, and posterior midgut invagination indentation on `datasets/global_morphogenetic_flow/drosophila_germband_extension_specimen.jpg`.",
            "remediation needed: Evaluate all 6 Streichan et al. (2018) regimes (`wildtype_gbe_anisotropic_plus_pmg`, `anisotropic_dv_cables_only`, `twist_snail_ventral_furrow_mutant`, `isotropic_myosin_only_no_nematic_q`, `eve_pair_rule_mutant`, `bcd_nos_tsl_maternal_triple_mutant`) and a 15x15 2D `(ell_H x eta_b/eta)` parameter morphospace.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a full 2D spectral/finite-difference compressible Stokes-Brinkman PDE solver `eta*nabla^2 v + eta_b*nabla(nabla.v) - (eta/ell_H^2)*v = -nabla.sigma^a` on the cartographic Drosophila blastoderm domain with Lagrangian germband extension marker advection." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.576"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

